  "_comment": "Terms that must survive translation intact. A monastery is not a 'Kloster Rumtek' in the sense that Rumtek can be translated — Rumtek is the name, and only the common noun around it changes. This file separates the two so a translation pipeline can localise the noun and leave the name alone.",
  "_rule": "canonical = never translated, never transliterated. commonNoun = translated per language. The generic word is the ONLY part that moves.",
